    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Edward Hunter Davies, OBE (born 7 January 1936) is a British author, journalist and broadcaster. He is the author of a number of books, including the only authorised biography of the Beatles.",
