      "node_id": "kg_doc_9",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Clive Stanley Donner (21 January 1926 – 6 September 2010) was a British film director who was a defining part of the British New Wave, directing films such as \"The Caretaker\", \"Nothing But the Best\", \"Here We Go Round the Mulberry Bush\" and \"What's New Pussycat? \". He also directed television movies and commercials through the mid-1990s.",
